{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your journey begins on foreboding grounds above ancient, mysterious ruins. Driven by an insatiable thirst for glory, power, and untold riches, you will face challenges and uncover dark secrets as you pursue your damned ambitions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/b7334ca638e3337d8375546c953f9cf0.webp?t=1754914516\" width=616 height=30 /></span>Form a party with up to four other friends, or brave the darkness alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/b2c6648bc0fdd5935771285295fc8e25.webp?t=1754914516\" width=616 height=30 /></span>Descend into forgotten dungeons teeming with nightmarish creatures, deadly traps, unstable structures, hidden drops, and toxic gasses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/a0c9cf81207aa22082d05b110e704745.poster.avif?t=1754914516\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/a0c9cf81207aa22082d05b110e704745.webm?t=1754914516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/a0c9cf81207aa22082d05b110e704745.mp4?t=1754914516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/5f67fbf1a7c160451cda2eae51ec8c07.webp?t=1754914516\" width=616 height=30 /></span>Death means losing your character and everything they carry, permanently. If you want to return out alive with your hard-earned loot\u2014be careful and deliberate. Anything stored in your base camp is safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/aa9931db17f689c2b975e73ee5521f8e.poster.avif?t=1754914516\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/aa9931db17f689c2b975e73ee5521f8e.webm?t=1754914516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/aa9931db17f689c2b975e73ee5521f8e.mp4?t=1754914516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/4c5dfc253f092598758190ff27432e6a.webp?t=1754914516\" width=616 height=30 /></span>Assemble weapons from individual components: swords, maces, axes, polearms, spears, bows, or crossbows\u2014the choice is yours. Customize all gear with materials, tints, and liveries to perfectly suit your playstyle and sense of fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/48ca0f16205abb038f9c2a4764440b12.poster.avif?t=1754914516\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/48ca0f16205abb038f9c2a4764440b12.webm?t=1754914516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126410/extras/48ca0f16205abb038f9c2a4764440b12.mp4?t=175491451